      "portrait": "American realistic comic book portrait of a 26-year-old Chinese woman, contemporary China, a resident physician at a community clinic on day eleven of a zombie outbreak, slim build, pale tired face, steady calm eyes, long black hair tied in a low ponytail, white doctor's coat with sleeves buttoned to the wrist over a dark sweater, calm polite expression, bold ink linework, painterly shading, desaturated post-apocalyptic palette, half-length shot",
